OL,3,GNEWSAPolice believe this is the face of
OL,4,AStanley Park murder victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FForensic experts have reconstructed the
OL,7,Fface of a woman whose remains were
OL,8,Ffound in a park in Liverpool, prompting
OL,9,Fa murder investigation.
OL,11,FA body was discovered in a black bin
OL,12,Fbag in the walled garden of Stanley
OL,13,FPark in Anfield on 28 August, and was
OL,14,Fbelieved to have been there for six
OL,15,Fweeks.
OL,17,FDespite repeated public appeals and
OL,18,Fdoor-knocking over 1,000 homes in the
OL,19,Farea, Merseyside Police officers have
OL,20,Fnot yet been able to identify the
OL,21,Fvictim.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
